"The template may contain the following tags:<ul><li>%y or %yyyy - the year "
"of the documents date.</li><li>%yy - the year of the document (two digits).</"
"li><li>%w - the week number of the documents date.</li><li>%ww - the week "
"number of the documents date with leading zero.</li><li>%d - the day number "
"of the documents date.</li><li>%dd - the day number of the documents date "
"with leading zero.</li><li>%m or %M - the month number of the documents date."
"</li><li>%MM - the month number with leading zero.</li><li>%c - the customer "
"id from kaddressbook</li><li>%i - the unique counter</li><li>%type - the "
"localised doc type (offer, invoice etc.)</li></ul>%i needs to be part of the "
"template."
